    )
    (property "Notes" "VBAT_4S input bulk, 16.8V max. SPEC IS CAPACITANCE AT BIAS, NOT NAMEPLATE: an MLCC's value collapses under DC bias regardless of its voltage rating, so '10uF' alone is meaningless here. Was 0805 25V, which at 16.8V retains only a small fraction. Moved to 1210/50V X7R on 2026-08-17 because bias derating is driven by case size and dielectric, not by the rating. MUST VERIFY the derated value on Murata SimSurfing (or the vendor's own C-vs-Vdc curve) before ordering and confirm it meets the TPS54336A input-capacitance requirement; do not accept a substitute chosen on nameplate value alone." (at 449.58 49.53 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))
    )
